@Kumbara.Identity.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Health Check
GET {{Kumbara.Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Register
POST {{Kumbara.Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

### Login
POST {{Kumbara.Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{Kumbara.Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}
